  description: "Once per turn, when an attack is declared involving your monster:
    You can roll a six-sided die and apply this effect to that monster you control
    based on the result until the end of this turn. If you activated this effect
    when an attack was declared involving 2 monsters in the same column, you choose
    the effect instead.\r\n\u25CF 1 or 4: The first time it would be destroyed by
    battle or card effect, it is not destroyed.\r\n\u25CF 2 or 5: It loses 500 ATK,
    also it is unaffected by activated Spell/Trap effects, except \"Early Palm Gets
    the Win\".\r\n\u25CF 3 or 6: It gains 1000 ATK, also it can make up to 2 attacks
    on monsters during each Battle Phase."
